      "spam": false,
      "value": "Additionally, while we are talking about user facing performance options. \n\nA possible menu in the options someday:\nMirrors:\n    [Stereoscopic]\n    [Monoscopic]\n    [Always off]\n\nMirrors are currently being abused by people who don't know better. Until they run as well as they use to, this option would go a long way to not making worlds sickening.\n\nRelated:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/put-notice-on-vrcmirror-prefab-they-lag-vr-users",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
