      "spam": false,
      "value": "You can make a monoscopic mirror right now in the currrent SDK.\n\nJust make a camera in a fixed position behind where you want the mirror, and use the camera view on a quad. Instant monoscopic mirror.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
