  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be great if we could somehow set mirrors to be monoscopic to help make them more performant.\n\nEither via a user facing global toggle, or via triggers we can use in the world, or automatically based on how fast the scene is being rendered.\n\nI think a lot of people would opt for Monoscopic over lower frame rate.",
